{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874490/extras/a05816200ddbbc6607c0ea70a0f22622.webp?t=1762947528\" width=600 height=41 /></span><br>\u201cDenrei Survivors\u201d is a 2D pixel-art action game that combines **Vampire Survivors-like** gameplay with **roguelite** elements,  <br>set in a unique **cyberpunk** world.<br><br>You play as a high school girl fighting against hordes of enemies \u2014 middle-aged men who have transformed into electric spirits known as **Denrei**.  <br>Survive, defeat them, choose from a wide variety of weapons and items, power up your own custom build,  <br>and dive deeper and deeper into the depths of the **Deep Dungeon**!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874490/extras/df5eabafaa329eabc24540dcc85f261e.poster.avif?t=1762947528\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874490/extras/df5eabafaa329eabc24540dcc85f261e.webm?t=1762947528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874490/extras/df5eabafaa329eabc24540dcc85f261e.mp4?t=1762947528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874490/extras/4c46f695ff06c4d3cc0e877af4d7cbbd.webp?t=1762947528\" width=600 height=41 /></span><br>Randomly generated dungeons and enemies \u2014 and your choices.  <br>Luck, growth, and decision-making create a **new adventure every time** you play.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874490/extras/cd5545a66cc032bed9d9f4295def59ea.avif?t=1762947528\" width=600 height=104 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874490/extras/bbff4461aadc06d7af34db447d8e79cb.webp?t=1762947528\" width=600 height=41 /></span><br>\u2026One night, a massive lightning bolt struck Tokyo Skytree, obliterating the city.  <br>But that same night, countless middle-aged men who perished turned into ectoplasmic beings \u2014  <br>resurrected as **\u201cDenrei\u201d**, electric spirits wandering Tokyo, driven purely by desire.<br><br>In that hellish Tokyo, transformed overnight into a demon city,  <br>one high school girl miraculously survived\u2026  <br>You play as that girl \u2014 harness the power of the Denrei,  <br>slaughter the swarming middle-aged spirits, and send them back to heaven!!!!!!  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874490/extras/93746c864d889587adecc6ea4e114aef.avif?t=1762947528\" width=600 height=104 /></span><br><br>This is a **Cyberpunk \u00d7 Middle-aged Men \u00d7 High School Girl \u00d7 Roguelite**  <br>ultra-futuristic sci-fi survivor-style action game!<br><br>This entire game (except for the music) was made **entirely by me \u2014 a 48-year-old man!!!!!!!**  <br>Uwaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa!!  <br>Please buy it! Please play it! I\u2019m begging youuuuuuuuuuuuuuuu!!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874490/extras/9aeab688d3d9db4d6a5030dd4a80867d.avif?t=1762947528\" width=600 height=194 /></span><br>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Area1 Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3874490/45e2cd963c45a631e87492078b22275e7127000f.jpg"},{"name":"Area2 Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3874490/3d6c497b5936a42da7719b650ab0b2e6674d2124.jpg"},{"name":"Area3 Cle